# What the Claude job runs: each session in its own job, on a new simulator with the app as the smoke test leaves it.
# sessions: their names; parallel: how many of their jobs run at once, 1 unless set.
# cases-<session>: its cases; layout-<session>: reachable (the one-hand UI, unless set) or top; plan-<session>: its plan here,
# device-test-plan.md unless set; entries-<session> (optional): the directory entries and names its cases use.
# backend: yes when the cases use the test backend; a run that asks for Claude must then start it too.
# max-turns, max-budget-usd and max-minutes bound each session.
backend: yes
model: claude-sonnet-5-5
sessions: banner markdown
cases-banner: B1, B2, B3, B4, B5
plan-banner: bugfix-banner-plan.md
cases-markdown: M1, M2, M3, M4, M5, M6
plan-markdown: bugfix-markdown-plan.md
max-turns: 200
max-budget-usd: 15
max-minutes: 90
